WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:09.480
Fight!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:18.700
 

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.700
 

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.880
 

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:43.080
 

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:52.400
 

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.740
You are literally blowing into a fan, there(!)

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.380
Lego with a hat.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.380
It's an origami toad.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:10.860
 

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.960
That's pretty advanced for this competition.
Versus, er... Baby Bl... oh, bloody hell!

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:22.280
 

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.420
I don't know which side the crowd
will be on in this one.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.380
We have beautiful, hand-made,
crocheted robot...

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.200
...versus a toilet.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.580
 

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:45.380
Piloted by someone from
actual Robot Wars...

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.240
No way you come out of this looking good, mate.
No matter what!

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.180
Lost a wheel, there's a wheel gone there -- oh!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.260
Oh, koala-bot is gone!

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.680
So our grand final...

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:09.540
Will Tictac and Pingu
please take to the stage!

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.080
2! 1! Activate!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:15.200
 

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:18.700
 

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:25.900
 

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:31.280
6! 5! 4! 3! 2! 1!

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.280
The winner has to be: Tictac!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.420
 

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.800
For your astonishing efforts
despite failing immediately, I award you...

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.800
this box!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:51.160
And the prize for the winner of Hebocon UK

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.780
at Electromagnetic Field 2016

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.140
and a very deserving winner,

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.180
please give it up

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.200
for Tictac!

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:10.400
That was Hebocon, we hope you enjoyed the show,
good night!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.900
Thank you to our film crew,
thank you to all the roboteers,

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.900
thank you to Jim for running everything

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.900
I'm going to get out of this tuxedo.
Good night!

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.900
